	'messages:config-no-db' => 'en:Could not find a suitable database driver! You need to install a database driver for PHP.
The following database {{PLURAL:$2|type is|types are}} supported: $1.

If you compiled PHP yourself, reconfigure it with a database client enabled, for example, using <code>./configure --with-mysqli</code>.
If you installed PHP from a Debian or Ubuntu package, then you also need to install, for example, the <code>php-mysql</code> package.',
	'messages:config-no-fts3' => 'en:<strong>Warning:</strong> SQLite is compiled without the [//sqlite.org/fts3.html FTS3 module], search features will be unavailable on this backend.',
	'messages:config-pcre-invalid-newline' => 'en:<strong>Fatal:</strong> The PCRE2 library seems to be compiled with <code>--enable-newline-is-any</code>.
